## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
## Secrets & local environment overrides — never commit real credentials.
## appsettings.json / appsettings.Production.json in this repo intentionally
## contain only placeholders ("CHANGE_ME") or blanks meant to be overridden
## by environment variables at deploy time (see each file's own _comment).
## Any *.Local.json / *.local.json variant is where a real local override
## would go instead — keep those out of source control.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

## dotnet user-secrets are stored outside the repo (in the user profile),
## but ignore this anyway in case a secrets id ever gets misconfigured
## into an in-repo path.
**/secrets/

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
## .NET build output
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
publish/

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
## Angular / Node build output & dependencies
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.angular/
frontend/.angular/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
## Editors / OS cruft
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
## Local file storage (see Storage:Provider=LocalFileSystem in
## appsettings.json) — uploaded attachments/voice notes written to disk
## during local development should never end up in source control.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------
api/src/DaftechCrm.Api/storage/
storage/uploads/
